      "id": "claim_cc9d29d3f2fe46d290eb30c9a8f12515",
      "statement": "Extractor._validate_dependencies requires a document loader only when vision is off, always requires an LLM, and demands a Pydantic-derived response model; the Contract branch of the model check references a name that is never imported in extractor.py, so invalid response models hit NameError.",
