    {
      "id": "claim_0afce337e811433da7328f3d8ad52aea",
      "statement": "The Extractor resolves loaders with two different orders: extraction's get_document_loader prefers the primary loader then extension map then capability scan then DocumentLoaderData for list/dict then DocumentLoaderLLMImage under allow_vision, while classify's get_document_loader_for_file checks the extension map (without a capability re-check) before the primary loader and raises ValueError when nothing matches.",
